Unit 3 25
Period 2 / Reading and comprehension
1 Discuss the questions in pairs or small groups.
Has anything like the following ever happened to you or someone you know?
Tell your partner(s) about it.
▸
meeting someone you know in an unexpected place
▸
thinking about someone and getting a message from the same person soon afterwards
▸
